  IF v_id IS NULL THEN
    INSERT INTO "HelpEntry"
      (keywords, title, content, min_level, category, usage, source_file, updated_at)
    VALUES (
      ARRAY['wimpy']::text[],
      'Wimpy',
      $help$WIMPY makes you flee a fight by yourself when your hit points drop below
a percentage of your maximum.

  wimpy 30         flee when below 30 percent
  wimpy off        turn it off (wimpy 0 does the same)
  wimpy            show the current setting

New characters start with wimpy on, so a losing fight ends in a flee and
not a death.

See also: FLEE.$help$,
      0,
      'command',
      'wimpy [{percent}|off]',
      'data/help/wimpy.md',
